  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px;color:#36f\"><strong>本模组已合并至 Amendments</strong></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/amendments\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/951/632/638441223877296738.gif\" alt=\"Amendments\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\"></strong></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px;color:#f00\"><strong>Carpeted</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/qdKRTDf8Cv\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790151253144895508?label=&color=2d2d2d&labelColor=dddddd&style=for-the-badge&logo=Discord&\" alt=\"Supplementaries Discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/mehvahdjukaar\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint.svg?url=https://shieldsio-patreon.vercel.app/api?username=mehvahdjukaar&type=patrons&style=for-the-badge&label=&color=2d2d2d&labelColor=dddddd&\" alt=\"在 Patreon 上支持我\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.twitter.com/Supplementariez\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitter/follow/Supplementariez?label=&color=2d2d2d&labelColor=dddddd&style=for-the-badge&logo=Twitter&message=Twitter&\" alt=\"Supplementaries Twitter\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCOaLLgwzOdbH6rCI7izCptw\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/youtube/channel/subscribers/UCOaLLgwzOdbH6rCI7izCptw?label=&color=2d2d2d&labelColor=dddddd&style=for-the-badge&logo=Youtube&message=Twitter&logoColor=ff0000\" alt=\"Supplementaries Twitter\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Jon7LVg.png\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\"></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong>📖 简介 📖</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Carpeted 是一个非常简单的模组，允许玩家将地毯放置在台阶和半砖的顶部。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">该模组仅添加一个方块，并会自动适配任何台阶/半砖或任何地毯组合，包括其他模组添加的内容。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">要获得地毯台阶，只需将地毯物品放置在任意朝上的台阶方块上即可。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">若要移除，只需正常破坏该方块即可。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">就是这样啦！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Jon7LVg.png\" width=\"1519\" height=\"37\"></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>❤️支持我❤️</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">制作模组占用了我大量时间，如果你认可我的工作并希望支持我，可以通过这里进行。支持后将为你专属定制 <strong>地球仪 </strong>或 <strong>雕像</strong>&nbsp;！如果你使用“supplementaries”优惠码在 Akliz 购买服务器，同样适用。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://ko-fi.com/mehvahdjukaar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sroRu1I.png\" alt=\"Ko-Fi\" width=\"346\" height=\"68\"></a></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:left\">\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\">需要服务器？试试 Akliz，他们提供专为模组版我的世界打造的高质量服务器。</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:18px\">他们拥有温馨的玩家社区、优质的客服支持以及出色的服务器体验</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">使用优惠码“supplementaries”可享<strong>&nbsp;8折优惠</strong>&nbsp;，同时还能支持我！</span></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:left\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/g5B76A8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" height=\"150\"></div>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Jon7LVg.png\" width=\"1688\" height=\"42\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>🦉 我们的其他模组🦉</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/haunted-harvest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/769/890/638107786158633425.gif\" alt=\"闹鬼丰收\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/snowy-spirit\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/488/371/637792657482121666.png\" alt=\"雪之灵\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/labels\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/623/301/638017052310334649.png\" alt=\"储物标签\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/goated\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/767/944/638104301571813998.png\" alt=\"Goated\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mystical-oak-tree\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/628/707/638025814904126005.gif\" alt=\"神秘橡树\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/carpeted-stairs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/658/179/638058347698730749.png\" alt=\"地毯楼梯\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mmmmmmmmmmmm\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/727/100/638080208599452100.png\" alt=\"MmmMmmMmmMmm\" width=\"125\" height=\"125\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moyai\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars